{"full":"hf:zxcvb20001/NeuroOracle","spaceId":"zxcvb20001/NeuroOracle","name":"NeuroOracle","source":"huggingface","description":"Dual-source knowledge graph for NeuroClaw","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","neuroscience","knowledge-graph","neuroimaging","hypothesis-generation","autoresearch","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":3,"created":"2026-05-19T08:05:38.000Z","updated":"2026-09-13T20:53:02.000Z","license":"mit","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://zxcvb20001-neurooracle.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/zxcvb20001/NeuroOracle","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T18:59:28.733Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T18:59:28.733Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T18:59:28.733Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🧠","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A dual-source knowledge graph and hypothesis engine — part of NeuroClaw.","NeuroOracle is the knowledge-graph component of NeuroClaw, an autonomous research framework for neuroimaging. It combines two complementary information sources to provide a quality-grounded foundation for hypothesis generation:","Together they form a graph of approximately 89K concept nodes and 174K edges, covering brain anatomy, diseases, genes, neurotransmitters, drugs, cognitive functions, imaging features, connectivity, visual stimuli, and emotion/vigilance labels."],"features":["Curated structured databases — concepts and relations imported from NeuroNames, MeSH, DisGeNET, BrainMap, and Cognitive Atlas, all aligned to UMLS semantic types.","PubMed-derived scientific claims — evidence-weighted edges extracted from neuroimaging literature using LLM-based claim extractors, with provenance (PMID, p-value, sample size, study type) preserved on every edge.","Generate hypotheses with traceable evidence chains back to specific PubMed papers","Filter or re-rank hypotheses using evidence weights (effect size, sample size, replicability)","Iterate the graph itself in response to new findings, rather than treating the KG as a static asset"],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/zxcvb20001/NeuroOracle/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"560f8d14e5f53668fd283069ddfe0dd5e7f231d94c5f1bfbaf1ceaf09b78f9aa","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T18:59:28.770Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T18:59:28.770Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A dual-source knowledge graph and hypothesis engine — part of NeuroClaw.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/zxcvb20001/NeuroOracle/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"560f8d14e5f53668fd283069ddfe0dd5e7f231d94c5f1bfbaf1ceaf09b78f9aa","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/zxcvb20001/NeuroOracle/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T18:59:28.770Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-13T20:53:02.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/zxcvb20001/NeuroOracle/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T18:59:28.770Z","hash":"560f8d14e5f53668fd283069ddfe0dd5e7f231d94c5f1bfbaf1ceaf09b78f9aa","originalBytes":4874,"storedBytes":4874,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["neuroclaw","neurooracle","graph","evidence","hypothesis","dual-source","neuroimaging","research","arxiv","claims","cognitive","imaging","knowledge","license","size","visual","what","across","autoresearch","chains","concepts","connectivity","curated","dataset","disease","domain","edges","emotion","engine","every","feature","filter","framework","gene","github","hypotheses","knowledge-graph","memory","mit","model","multi-hop","neurobench","page","paper","please","project","pubmed-derived","report","sample","scientific","source","space","stimulus","structured","system","tags","technical","title","type","using","vigilance","agent","agentic","aligned","anatomical","anatomy","anchor","app","approximately","article","asset","atlas","author","autonomous","back","behind","benchmark","bibtex","biomarker","blue","brain","brainmap","broa